OL,3,ATeenager arrested aged 16 jailed after
OL,4,Aterror conviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who was 16 when he was
OL,7,Farrested at Heathrow Airport has been
OL,8,Fjailed after being convicted of
OL,9,Fproviding cyber-security support to
OL,10,Fgroups including al-Qaeda.
OL,12,FYusuf Shah, from Ilford, was also found
OL,13,Fto have downloaded documents including
OL,14,Finstructions on how to make explosives
OL,15,Fand how to use different types of
OL,16,Fweapons.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
