OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATeenager arrested aged 16 jailed after
OL,4,Aterror conviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnalysis of Shah's phone found that he
OL,7,Fhad accessed an online magazine
OL,8,Fpublished by al-Qaeda that contained
OL,9,Finformation on how to carry out acts of
OL,10,Fterrorism, and had engaged in chat
OL,11,Fgroups where he offered technical help.
OL,13,FCdr Helen Flanagan, head of Counter
OL,14,FTerrorism Policing London, said the
OL,15,Fcase should act as a "warning to
OL,16,Fparents and carers to be aware of what
OL,17,Ftheir children are doing online".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
